                <pb facs="0575" n="479" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg479"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Buck.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ask inclusion Kobe permission land horses; transports may coal there.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
